  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `get_post_options` and `set_post_options` in `crates/app/src/mcp/post_options_tools.rs`.\n- Registered both tools in `crates/app/src/mcp/mod.rs` and `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs`.\n- Omitting `setup` (or passing `null`) reads or writes the document's `PostOptions` through `SetPostOptions`.\n- Naming `setup` reads that setup's resolved options or writes its own through `SetSetupPostOptions`.\n- Passing `follow: true` with `setup` returns the setup to following the document (`None`), and `follow: false` snapshots the resolved options as the setup's own.\n- Added `crates/app/tests/mcp_post_options.rs`, `docs/decisions/1534-post-options.md`, and tool rows in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`.\n\n## Cause\nThe GUI exposed `SetPostOptions` and `SetSetupPostOptions`, while `crates/app/src/mcp/` had no tool to read or set post options.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins (`crates/app/tests/mcp_post_options.rs`): `tools_list_includes_post_options_tools`, `set_post_options_on_setup2_leaves_setup1_and_document_unchanged_and_undo_restores`, `set_post_options_document_fields_and_follow_reset`, `post_options_refuses_bad_inputs_and_no_ops_by_name` (failed 4/4 before the fix, passed 4/4 after).\n- Mutations: reverting `tools.rs` failed 4/4; adding implicit active-setup routing failed 3/4; dropping the `follow`-without-`setup` guard failed 1/4; dropping the `follow: true` with fields guard failed 1/4; treating `null` booleans as omitted failed 1/4; restoring each passed 4/4.\n- Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (72 `camcraft-app` suites + lib, 233s, 0 failed); `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed (0 warnings).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- GUI rendering and batch/release tiers did not run here.\n- End-to-end NC output changes after `set_post_options` rely on the existing `SetPostOptions` and `SetSetupPostOptions` posting tests.\n\n## Overlaps\n- PR #1699 touches `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` (`import_model` description, different function; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- PR #1695 touches `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` (Section 5 alignment tools, different section; whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nProcess change: yes\nChangelog: MCP `get_post_options` and `set_post_options` tools for explicit document and per-setup post options (#1534)\nFixes #1534\n",
